    <panel_attributes>title=SD02 - Generate and Optimize Grocery List   (UC06, UC07; F07, F08, F09, F12)\nThe page calls the facade in-process; the CLI (GroceryCommand, PlanCommand cheaper) and the assistant call the same operations
obj=Meal Planner~U ACTOR
obj=:MealPlanningGUI\n(Groceries and Meal plan pages)~GUI
obj=:MealPlanningFacade~F
obj=:MealPlanService~MPS
obj=:GroceryService~GS
obj=:PantryService~PS
obj=pantry:Pantry~P
obj=prices:\nStatCanPriceDataSource~PDS
obj=:GroceryListRepository~GLR
obj=:BudgetService~BS
obj=:AgentController~AC
obj=:MealPlanningAgent~AG
obj=:ToolManager~TM
obj=:RecipeTool~RT
obj=:ProviderLLMAdapter\n«LLMClient»~LLM
obj=:ProposalValidator~PV
obj=:ConstraintValidator~CV

U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 1: Refresh list and\ncheck budget
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 2: generateOptimizedGroceryList(\nprofileId); on=F
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;MPS : 3: getActivePlan(profileId); on=MPS
MPS.&gt;F : 4: plan; off=MPS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS : 5: refreshForPlan(plan); on=GS
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PS : 6: getPantry(profileId); on=PS
PS.&gt;GS : 7: pantry; off=PS
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS + : 8:\ngenerateList(\nplan, pantry)
tick=1
combinedFragment=loop~L1 GS P; P:[each consolidated requirement (servings scaled, optional lines skipped)]
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;P : 9: take(requirement, startDate); on=P
P.&gt;GS : 10: amount still to buy (expired\nstock is not counted); off=P
--=L1
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GS + : 11:\noptimizeList(\nlist)
tick=1
combinedFragment=loop~L2 GS PDS; P:[each GroceryItem with toBuy &gt; 0]
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;PDS : 12: estimatePrice(ingredient, toBuy); on=PDS
PDS.&gt;GS : 13: price, or none (the estimate is partial); off=PDS
--=L2
GS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GLR : 14: save(list)
GS.&gt;F : 15: priced GroceryList; off=GS
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;BS : 16: evaluate(list, budgetFor(weeklyBudget, days)); on=BS
BS.&gt;F : 17: BudgetStatus (estimate, shortfall, costDrivers, partial); off=BS
combinedFragment=alt~A GUI CV; F:[within budget, or no budget set]
F.&gt;GUI : 18: AgentResponse(SUCCESS,\nlist, status)
..=A; F:[over budget: UC07 extends UC06]
F.&gt;GUI : 19: AgentResponse(CONFLICT,\nlist, status, cost drivers)
GUI.&gt;U : 20: over-budget warning\nwith the biggest costs
U-&gt;&gt;&gt;GUI : 21: Make it cheaper\n(Meal plan page)
GUI-&gt;&gt;&gt;F : 22: suggestCheaperPlan(profileId)
F-&gt;&gt;&gt;AC : 23: resolveBudgetConflict(plan, status); on=AC
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG : 24: proposeChange(context in BUDGET mode,\n"make it cheaper, biggest costs ..."); on=AG
combinedFragment=loop~T AG LLM; TM:[step &lt;= maxToolSteps and the LLM has not chosen "finish"]
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 25: generateStructured(prompt, next_action schema, INSTRUCTIONS); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 26: recipeSearch call, or finish; off=LLM
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;TM : 27: isValidCall(), then execute(toolName, args, context); on=TM
TM-&gt;&gt;&gt;RT : 28: execute(args, context); on=RT
RT.&gt;TM : 29: ToolResult(cheaper candidates); off=RT
TM.&gt;AG : 30: ToolResult; off=TM
--=T
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;AG + : 31:\nrankRecipes(\ncandidates,\ncontext)
tick=1
AG-&gt;&gt;&gt;LLM : 32: generateStructured(prompt, plan_change schema, INSTRUCTIONS); on=LLM
LLM.&gt;AG : 33: replacements with rationale; off=LLM
AG.&gt;AC : 34: ChangeAttempt(PlanChange, toolCalls); off=AG
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;PV : 35: validate(change, context); on=PV
PV.&gt;AC : 36: ValidationResult; off=PV
AC-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 37: validateChange(change, context); on=CV
CV.&gt;AC : 38: ValidationResult (restrictions, time, recalculated cost); off=CV
AC.&gt;F : 39: AgentResponse(NEEDS_CONFIRMATION, change); off=AC
F.&gt;GUI : 40: cheaper meals to preview
text=GUI:on confirmation the change is\napplied as in SD03 (confirmChange),\nand the list is recalculated, never\nassumed to be within budget
--=A
off=F
GUI.&gt;U : 41: shopping list with estimate\nand warnings</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes />
  </element>
